WEBVTT

00:00:09,140 --> 00:00:17,140
Turning 60 in a few weeks and wrestling with everyone needs a colonoscopy at age 55 or older.

00:00:17,140 --> 00:00:22,140
I had a PET CT scan three years ago when that have showed any issues.

00:00:22,140 --> 00:00:25,140
What are your thoughts on these things?

00:00:25,140 --> 00:00:32,140
Well, we've had patients that have discovered colon cancer via a colonoscopy.

00:00:32,140 --> 00:00:37,140
And so it's hard for me to knock colonoscopies.

00:00:37,140 --> 00:00:45,140
In the same sense, I've never had a colonoscopy and I don't plan on ever getting a colonoscopy.

00:00:45,140 --> 00:00:49,140
But I'm not saying you should do as I do.

00:00:49,140 --> 00:00:52,140
There's pros and cons to a colonoscopy.

00:00:52,140 --> 00:00:59,140
So just like any medical procedure, this is not a non-invasive one, obviously.

00:00:59,140 --> 00:01:06,140
So, yeah, I mean, especially if you've had a PET scan and CT scan three years ago,

00:01:06,140 --> 00:01:10,140
it certainly would decrease the need for a colonoscopy.

00:01:10,140 --> 00:01:22,140
No, because, yeah, I mean, one could argue that, well, that is just, you know,

00:01:22,140 --> 00:01:27,140
what if you have polyps growing now that could be plucked out that could be precancerous?

00:01:27,140 --> 00:01:30,140
Yeah, you could make that argument.

00:01:30,140 --> 00:01:35,140
So, yeah, it's hard for me to knock doing a colonoscopy.

00:01:36,140 --> 00:01:43,140
What it is, you know, kind of the only preventative procedure that medicine really does.

00:01:43,140 --> 00:01:49,140
But in the same sense, you know, people have had issues with them too.

00:01:49,140 --> 00:01:53,140
Or can I just get a cologuard test?

00:01:53,140 --> 00:02:02,140
A cologuard test is actually the same technology for those who have been with me for, you know, five plus years.

00:02:02,140 --> 00:02:04,140
We had the IBG test.

00:02:04,140 --> 00:02:12,140
So, the IBG test uses the cologuard test, I should say, uses the exact same technology as the IBG test there.

00:02:12,140 --> 00:02:17,140
Literally, the exact same technology.

00:02:17,140 --> 00:02:28,140
IBG went the way of trying to sell it to practitioners that would, you know, that were, you know, trying to do preventative care and cancer care.

00:02:28,140 --> 00:02:37,140
Um, cologuard went the way of selling out to a pharmaceutical company that then got an approved for insurance function.

00:02:37,140 --> 00:02:41,140
So, um, in cologards to the round.

00:02:41,140 --> 00:02:46,140
So, we'll figure people that want to pay cash for the test.

00:02:46,140 --> 00:02:50,140
So, I don't know if they will do cologuard.

00:02:50,140 --> 00:02:55,140
If you had it, you had two diagnosed the past, um, because it could throw that off.

00:02:55,140 --> 00:03:00,140
And if you still have cancer elsewhere or something, but you can certainly check into that.

